<title>UK: LB Schleswig-Holstein sets NZ$100 mln bond.</title>
<headline>LB Schleswig-Holstein sets NZ$100 mln bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Toronto Dominion.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESBANK SCHLESWIG-HOLSTEIN GZ</p>
<p> AMT    NZ$100 MLN    COUPON     7.75	MATURITY    07.APR.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.775   PAY DATE    07.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.125     LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AAA   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  0.875     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
